WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.474
The new upper and lower bounds bracket the error
across sample sizes on both kernels,

00:00:05.554 --> 00:00:07.891
and squeeze together as samples grow.

00:00:07.971 --> 00:00:14.686
Against Bach's bound the gain is stark: the new
bound hugs the true error while Bach's floats far above.

00:00:14.766 --> 00:00:16.189
In the ridgeless limit,

00:00:16.269 --> 00:00:20.370
bias reduces to the finite-rank error and variance
to the noise.
